# Build-context filter for docker/Dockerfile (BuildKit reads <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# Keep the context to what `dotnet publish` of the web host needs.
**/bin/
**/obj/
.git/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
storage/
# The Tailwind CSS CLI (one binary per platform) and its output: the build downloads and runs the Linux one.
tools/
**/node_modules/
src/DotNetForge.UI/wwwroot/dnf.css
tests/
TestResults/
.docs/
.claude/
*.md
